OL,3,AWilliam and Kate reflect on 'enduring'
OL,4,AUK-India ties with Modi
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales have
OL,7,Freflected on the enduring ties between
OL,8,Fthe UK and India with its Prime
OL,9,FMinister Narendra Modi, and discussed
OL,10,Fopportunities to strengthen them.
OL,12,FWilliam and Catherine arrived in New
OL,13,FDelhi on Wednesday for the final leg of
OL,14,Ftheir three-day visit, the first
OL,15,Fofficial overseas trip together in four
OL,16,Fyears.
OL,18,FThe meeting was a late addition to the
OL,19,Fcouple's schedule and came after Modi
OL,20,Fconfirmed he would be back from a
OL,21,Fscheduled trip to the Philippines in
OL,22,Ftime to see the royals.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
